## *** THE CLASS, AND WHY THIS IS A FLOOR BREACH RATHER THAN DEBT ***

Every one of the six conditions the repair's EFFECT on a **POSITION OR TILE SELECTOR** —
`tile_nr`, `tile_nr_x`, `linear`, `y`. **The detector never notices because every row probes ONE
position.** That is clause (d): the guard is kept and its repair is nulled, at a cell no row
occupies.

This project's rule when a class recurs:

> **ENUMERATE THE FULL SPACE FROM THE FUNCTION'S OWN INPUTS, CLOSE EVERY CELL IN ONE DIFF, and
> write into the CONTRACT which cells are covered and which are deliberately not. The closing pass
> then VERIFIES THE ENUMERATION rather than hunting cells.**

Pass-per-instance converges linearly in cells and is how a `#392` chain starts. **Six escapes of
one shape is the trigger.**

